}\"\n  fi\ndone\necho \"${last_line}\"```","ts":"1618697297.380200","attachments":[{"fallback":"styleguide","id":1,"title":"styleguide","title_link":"https://google.github.io/styleguide/shellguide.html","text":"Style guides for Google-originated open-source projects","blocks":null,"service_name":"google.github.io","from_url":"https://google.github.io/styleguide/shellguide.html","original_url":"https://google.github.io/styleguide/shellguide.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"98AOm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25c5d72b-b160-4c8a-bd0c-2fa1be28d0ed","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/sheepla/fzpac\u003e","ts":"1618681892.378100","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: sheepla/fzpac","id":1,"title":"sheepla/fzpac","title_link":"https://github.com/sheepla/fzpac","text":"Arch Linux (pacman) package finder with fzf. Contribute to sheepla/fzpac development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/f9314a1afe9c1faf9c448cfdcaa5535d0c7aa0b91c31521528366dc96ee6d6f3/sheepla/fzpac","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/sheepla/fzpac","original_url":"https://github.com/sheepla/fzpac"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZUAZ"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01UUELMW9E","text":"\u003c@U01UUELMW9E\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1618677587.377900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
